{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And Elohim spoke to Noah, saying.</b> 'Speak to Noah in order to say to him' — it is a doubled expression in every place. So too 'HaShem spoke to Moses, saying.' And one instance in the section of Shemini proves it: 'HaShem spoke to Moses and to Aaron, saying to them' — 'saying' to Moses and to Aaron; and what did He say to them? 'Speak to the children of Israel: this is the creature that you may eat,' etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:03:30.566845476Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}